"Good morning. You have 40 unread emails. Only 3 of them matter."

That's not a movie. Stanford's AI lab just open-sourced a real Jarvis. OpenJarvis reads your inbox and calendar every morning and talks you through what actually matters. 14K+ stars on GitHub, open source, and it can run fully on your own computer.

🔗 GitHub: https://github.com/open-jarvis/OpenJarvis
🌐 Site: https://openjarvis.stanford.edu

⚡ Install (macOS / Linux / WSL):
curl -fsSL https://open-jarvis.github.io/OpenJarvis/install.sh | bash

Would you let Jarvis read your inbox? 👇

